<title>UK: UK court sanctions Lloyds Abbey scheme.</title>
<headline>UK court sanctions Lloyds Abbey scheme.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's High Court on Wednesday sanctioned the scheme of arrangement, under which Lloyds Abbey Life will become a wholly owned subsidiary of Lloyds TSB.</p>
<p>The scheme will become effective on December 23.</p>
<p>Lloyds announced the move to acquire the outstanding shares in the insurance group where it already held a majority stake in September.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
